      <div class="panel-head">
        <h2>ひらがな — Hiragana</h2>
        <p class="lead">Tap any character to trace it stroke by stroke and hear it spoken. Characters you mark as mastered get a 印 stamp.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="hiraganaGroups"></div>
