      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="panel-sounds">
      <div class="panel-head">
        <h2>伸ばす音・詰まる音</h2>
        <p class="lead">Two sound changes that are easy to miss by ear but change a word's meaning.</p>
      </div>
